							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">lets clear the air here... dawson, word. i think our approaches to this subject sprang from wildly different directions, and somehow i think your main point to me was lost in translation. outside of the fact i have a pretty lightning quick temper, (wich may be why i ended up inside in the first place), i think im a little too quick to try and boils someones point down to what i feel is the real essence of the issue, to cut through the highhanded bullshit, and maybe in that respect i have a habit of not taking the time to settle down and chew on what someone is trying to say. i dont retract any of what i said earlier, but im gonna apologize for taking the haevy handed route.<br /><br />and seaweed, straight up and down, my bad. i came at you on some rough and rugged shit and i didnt even fully read your response. so i apologize for being a dick. if i ever meet you in person im offering a soul pound.</div>
