							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%; padding-bottom: 3px;" class="signature">we movin&#039; kilos by the pound...<br /><br />the views expressed in this post don&#039;t necessarily reflect the opinions of MassLine or its affiliated entities. sometimes, however, said parties are correct.</div>
